---

By completing this project, participants will be able to:
* Retrieve biological sequences from public databases.
* Perform protein similarity searches using BLASTp.
* Select homologous sequences for comparative analysis.
* Conduct multiple sequence alignment using ClustalW.
* Construct phylogenetic trees in MEGA 12.
* Visualize phylogenetic trees using iTOL.
* Interpret evolutionary relationships based on protein sequence conservation.

